{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50384","headline":"晓发佛潭桥 · 陈元光","name":"晓发佛潭桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝暾催上道，兔魄欲西沈。\n去雁长空没，飞花曲径深。\n事沿桥树往，诗落海鸥吟。\n马鬣嘶风耸，龙旗闪电临。\n峯攒仙掌巧，露重将袍阴。\n农唤耕春早，僧迎展拜钦。\n看看葵日丽，照破艳阳心。\n（以上二诗见沈定均《漳州府志·艺文志》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}